o efficient and the caliph himself so ruthless that a man hardly dared to speak to his own wife in the privacy of his home."<br>Mercenary<br>Recruited mercenaries "from across ethnic and tribal communities that they hoped would be more loyal. Among people they recruited were Turks ... The Abbasid plan backfired, however, and eventually their hired guns took over running the affairs of the state."<br>Perso-Islamic<br>"traditional Perso-Islamic administrative apparatus developed in late Abbasid times".<br>2. Vizier<br>3.\xa0???<br>4.\xa0???<br>5.\xa0???<br>_Provincial government_<br>2.<br>3.\xa0???<br>4.\xa0???<br>5.\xa0???<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2531, 'temperature': 0.2})
