sumed that the settlement hierarchy corresponds with the administrative hierarchy for this period (the sites may have been competing with each other rather than in dominant or subordinate administrative positions).<br>1. Main administrative centre, corresponding with primary centres of the settlement hierarchy (e.g. San José Mogote)<br>2. Secondary administrative centres, corresponding with other smaller settlements with evidence for public architecture'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2488, 'temperature': 0.2})
