nts around the suggested territory of each princedom."<br>1. Paramount chieftain<br><br>2. Vassal chief<br>3. Sub-chief<br>4. Village chief<br>Hallstatt B2/3-C(900-600 BC)<br>A small fortification, the seat of the local aristocracy, polarizes each politically autonomous territory."<br>1. Aristocratic chief<br>2. Local chief<br>3. Village head<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2867, 'temperature': 0.2})
