e local elites were mantained and largely autonomous if appropriate tribute was paid to the tribal elites. <br>1. Shah<br>2. Immediate dynastic family and tribe<br>3. Tribal chieftains and holders of Jageirs (land grants)<br>4. Subjugated provincial elites<br>5. Local administrations of conquered territory<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2298, 'temperature': 0.2})
